22 0 obj
<< /A 456 0 R /Alt (Flowchart of study selection process. Identification phase: 442 studies from databases. 14 references removed as duplicates. Screening phase: 428 studies screened, 406 excluded, 21 sought for retrieval. No studies not retrieved. Eligibility phase: 21 studies assessed, 12 excluded due to wrong outcomes \(5\), wrong intervention \(3\), wrong study design \(3\), and wrong patient population \(1\). Included phase: 9 studies included in review.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 16 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
23 0 obj
<< /A 457 0 R /Alt (Pie chart illustrating the number of studies using various psychological scales. Generalized Anxiety Disorder Scale-7 \(5 studies\), Patient Health Questionnaire-9 and Positive and Negative Affect Schedule \(4 each\) are prominent. Other scales include the Short Warwick Edinburgh Mental Wellbeing Scale, Perceived Stress Scale, Brief Mood Introspection Scale, and more, each with one study.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 19 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
